Split out of [#4471](/kb/incidents/4471), with [#2](/kb/incidents/2) and [#3](/kb/incidents/3).

<TicketSummary problem="parser" ticket={1} repo="https://github.com/AdditionAddict/support-kb-4471" />

## What breaks

The shared parser reads every date month first. Every tenant here writes the day first, so any
date with a day of 12 or less swaps day and month: 7 April becomes 4 July. Every channel, every
tenant, except form bookings through booking-v3 ([#2](/kb/incidents/2)).

## Outcome

**Fixed** with `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`; #4471 closed on 5 October. The one-day
reports counted here are a different bug and stay open in [#3](/kb/incidents/3).

